# Simple CRM API — semantic version (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH, Lesson 4.5)
# Single source of truth for Docker image versioning in .github/workflows/docker.yml.
# CI reads the first MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH line found in this file and tags the image
# johnphs9/module4-deploy-simple-crm:<version> on every push to main.
#
# Bump rules:
#   MAJOR — breaking API/auth contract changes
#   MINOR — new features (e.g. 1.1.0 = SemVer image tagging added to the CI pipeline)
#   PATCH — bug fixes, docs, logging tweaks
